    "detailed_description": "Etnia is a retro style ARPG that supports up to one player. You will play as a teenager and embark on a bumpy adventure in pursuit of your dreams.<br>You will experience rich and colorful storylines on the Etnia continent; Collect treasures hidden in ruins and caves; Challenge bosses with diverse forms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features:</h2><br><strong>\u2022 150+unique equipment:</strong><br>Each piece of equipment has its unique effects, collect and match them to create your own unique combat style.<br>For example: [The Game of the Ranger]+[Anger of Nature]<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209320/extras/df6ffa6c4764afad3c6bac3c39deb1f2.avif?t=1755576547\" width=278 height=380 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209320/extras/1cbe03abbb01826b8d0819e7bebdfe3d.avif?t=1755576547\" width=280 height=354 /></span><br>Now, all you need to do is cover the grass around the monster, and then... it's about to explode!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209320/extras/f77af6240f40c9275cee8b666f32983d.poster.avif?t=1755576547\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209320/extras/f77af6240f40c9275cee8b666f32983d.webm?t=1755576547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209320/extras/f77af6240f40c9275cee8b666f32983d.mp4?t=1755576547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u00b7 15+Active Skills:</strong><br>Master them and constantly suppress enemies in battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic